                <span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#2fb344;display:inline-block;animation:aiPulse 2s infinite"></span>
                AI can read data AND execute real actions — changes are applied immediately
            </div>
            <div class="ai-chat-starter-chips" id="chat-starter-chips">
